# Local environment for MindSpa POC.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in only what you need. With nothing set, the app runs
# on the local adapter with synthetic data, which is the supported default.

# The dedicated demo Convex deployment. When this is unset, the whole app runs offline
# against the local adapter with the same interface and the same rate limits.
# VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-demo-deployment

# The audio bucket prefix. Defaults to the demo bucket, which is a separate prefix
# from the private original. Audio also falls back to the bundled copies in
# public/audio, so an unset or unreachable bucket still plays.
# VITE_S3_AUDIO_BASE=https://s3.azril.io/mindspa-poc-demo/audio

# Shown in the More menu and on the splash. Defaults to the version in package.json.
# VITE_APP_VERSION=2.0.0
